# Client (AngularJS) conventions

## Module

Root module: **`plistCsvApp`** in `client/app/app.js`.

## Feature layout

`client/app/<feature>/`:

- `<feature>.js` — module + ui-router states
- `<feature>.controller.js` — logic (main uses `.component('main', …)`)
- `<feature>.html` — template
- `*.controller.spec.js` — Karma tests

Shared: `client/components/<name>/`.

## Main route (product)

`client/app/main/main.controller.js` owns CSV column layout, SunCalc night/day splits, employee filter (`empNum`), and plist upload → `/api/workouts/upload`. Treat changes here as **logbook semantics**, not cosmetic refactors.

## Build

Scripts are injected by Grunt (`Gruntfile.js`). No webpack/ES modules on the client.

## Do not

- Migrate to a modern frontend framework
- Modify `client/bower_components/` directly
- Change `$locationProvider.html5Mode` without cause
